  /**
   * Retrieve detailed information about a specific department by its unique identifier.
   *
   * This operation returns complete department details including its name, description, hierarchical position, and timestamps. The department belongs to an organization and may optionally have a parent department, supporting two-level organizational hierarchies.
   *
   * All organization members can access this endpoint to view department information. The response includes the parent department reference when applicable, enabling visual representation of the organizational structure.
   *
   * This endpoint supports building organizational charts and department browsing interfaces by providing individual department details that can be linked to parent-child relationships.
   *
