   *
   * Edge cases:
   * - Return 404 if department not found or belongs to different organization
   * - Handle parent department that may be soft-deleted
   * - Ensure proper organization isolation between tenants
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
