   * Query construction:
   * 1. Filter by project_id = path parameter projectId
   * 2. Apply soft delete filter where deleted_at IS NULL
   * 3. If role filter provided in request body, add WHERE role = {role}
   * 4. If organizationMemberId filter provided, add WHERE organization_member_id = {organizationMemberId}
   * 5. Join with erp_hrm_organization_members to get member details (position, employment_type, is_active)
   * 6. Join with erp_hrm_members via organization_members.user_id to get user profile (name)
   * 7. Join with erp_hrm_departments via organization_members.department_id to get department name (optional)
   *
   * Sorting options:
   * - created_at (default DESC for newest members first)
   * - role (alphabetical: member, project-lead)
   * - organization member name
   *
   * Pagination:
   * - Use cursor-based pagination with id as cursor
   * - Support limit with default 20, max 100
