   * Authorization check:
   * - Extract organization context from session
   * - Verify project belongs to the organization via project.organization_id
   * - Check if caller has project management permission OR is assigned to this project as project-lead
   *
   * Response structure:
   * - pagination: {cursor, limit, total}
   * - data: Array of IErpHrmProjectMember.ISummary with nested organizationMember and project fields
