   * @param projectMemberId Project member record identifier (UUID)
   * @param body Project member update data containing the new role designation
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor member
   * @x-autobe-specification Validate that the calling user has project management permission. Fetch the project member record by projectMemberId and verify it belongs to the specified projectId. Update the role field with the value from the request body (must be either 'member' or 'project-lead'). Update the updated_at timestamp to current time. Return the complete updated project member record with related data including project and organization member details.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
